ter_10x_Manipulation() (gas: 32993)\nLogs:\n  Initial price: 1000000000000000\n  Manipulated price: 10000000000000000\n  Price increase factor: 10\n  validatePrice after 10x manipulation: true\n\nSuite result: ok. 5 passed; 0 failed; 0 skipped; finished in 633.62µs (717.33µs CPU time)\n\nRan 1 test suite in 9.31ms (633.62µs CPU time): 5 tests passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped (5 total tests)\n```\n\n## Code Snippet\n\nhttps://github.com/valory-xyz/autonolas-tokenomics/blob/bbec5ac12721a62672fb7a5ffba5c40f5a46d8cb/contracts/oracles/UniswapPriceOracle.sol#L55-L91\n\n## Tool Used\n\nManual Review, Foundry\n\n## Recommendation\n\nImplement proper TWAP storage similar to `BalancerPriceOracle.sol`:\n\n```solidity\nstruct PriceSnapshot {\n    uint256 cumulativePrice;\n    uint256 lastUpdated;\n    uint256 averagePrice;\n}\n\nPriceSnapshot public snapshotHistory;\n\nfunction updatePrice() public returns (bool) {\n    uint256 currentPrice = getPrice();\n    PriceSnapshot storage snapshot = snapshotHistory;\n\n    if (snapshot.lastUpdated == 0) {\n        snapshot.averagePrice = currentPrice;\n        snapshot.lastUpdated = block.timestamp;\n        return true;\n    }\n\n    uint256 elapsedTime = block.timestamp - snapshot.lastUpdated;\n    if (elapsedTime == 0) return false;\n\n    snapshot.cumulativePrice += snapshot.averagePrice * elapsedTime;\n\n    uint256 averagePrice = (snapshot.cumulativePrice + (currentPrice * elapsedTime)) /\n        ((snapshot.cumulativePrice / snapshot.averagePrice) + elapsedTime);\n\n    snapshot.averagePrice = averagePrice;\n    snapshot.lastUpdated = block.timestamp;\n    return true;\n}\n\nfunction validatePrice(uint256 slippage) external view returns (bool) {\n    uint256 tradePrice = getPrice();\n    uint256 twap = snapshotHistory.averagePrice;\n\n    uint256 derivation = (tradePrice > twap)\n        ? ((tradePrice - twap) * 1e16) / twap\n        : ((twap - tradePrice) * 1e16) / twap;\n\n    return derivation <= slippage;\n}\n```\n\nAlternatively